[{"path":".env.example","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"# Never commit funded keys.\nGENLAYER_NETWORK=studionet\nGENLAYER_RPC=https://studio.genlayer.com/api\n"},{"path":".github/workflows/direct-tests.yml","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"name: Direct Mode\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\njobs:\n  direct-tests:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 15\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: '3.12'\n          cache: pip\n      - name: Install pinned test tooling\n        run: python -m pip install -r requirements-test.txt\n      - name: Repository preflight\n        run: python scripts/preflight.py\n      - name: Compile Python\n        run: python -m compileall -q contracts tests scripts\n      - name: Direct Mode tests\n        run: pytest tests/direct -q\n"},{"path":".gitignore","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":".env\n.venv/\nvenv/\n__pycache__/\n.pytest_cache/\n*.pyc\nartifacts/\n.DS_Store\n"},{"path":"AGENT_HANDOFF.txt","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"ConditionLatch finishing handoff\n\nCanonical repository: https://github.com/BeatyXO/conditionlatch\n\nThe repository is already substantially implemented, hardened, pinned to stable Studionet, and prepared with Direct Mode CI plus a live integration lifecycle. Do not redesign the product and do not add a frontend. Inspect the repository and current GitHub Actions status first.\n\nYour remaining job is limited to failures that still exist in the real GenLayer environment and the live Studionet proof that cannot be fabricated offline. Run `python scripts/preflight.py`, inspect CI, run Direct Mode locally only if needed to reproduce a real failure, then run `gltest tests/integration/test_studionet_lifecycle.py -v -s --network studionet` against stable Studionet (chain 61999 / https://studio.genlayer.com/api). Fix only genuine runtime/tooling issues without weakening validator independence, exact source binding, fail-closed behavior, temporal determinism, generation pinning, append-only history, or ConditionGate replay protection.\n\nBefore any live write, verify the effective network is `studionet`, RPC `https://studio.genlayer.com/api`, chain ID 61999. Do not move to Studio-dev/61997 or another network as a workaround.\n\nProduce and record only real evidence: ConditionLatch address/deploy transaction, condition create/source/seal transactions, definition hash, observation transactions and final snapshot/round hashes, ConditionGate address/deploy transaction, allowed gate action, replay rejection evidence, wrong-definition and wrong-generation rejection evidence, exact test results, and final commit SHA. Update `DEPLOYMENT.md`, `BUILD_STATUS.md`, `SUBMISSION.md`, and `proof/VERIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md` with only evidence actually produced.\n\nFinal gates: `python scripts/preflight.py --final` must pass; Python compilation and all Direct Mode tests must pass; the live Studionet lifecycle must pass; no secrets/caches/venvs/artifacts/frontend may be tracked; inspect git diff/status and the GitHub HEAD after push. At the end report exactly what changed, real test results, real addresses/transactions/hashes, final definition/snapshot/round hashes, final 40-character commit SHA, and any genuine remaining limitation.\n"},{"path":"BUILD_STATUS.md","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"# Build status\n\nCanonical repository: `https://github.com/BeatyXO/conditionlatch`\n\n## Implemented before live deployment\n\n- primary ConditionLatch contract;\n- DRAFT → ACTIVE → LATCHED lifecycle;\n- frozen source namespace and 64-hex definition hash;\n- TRUE / FALSE / INDETERMINATE semantic vocabulary;\n- storage-to-memory copying before nondeterministic execution;\n- independent leader/validator source re-fetch and semantic re-evaluation;\n- exact source snapshot binding;\n- 5,000-byte per-source bound with no hidden/unprompted hashed tail;\n- fail-closed HTTP, empty/oversized response, and model-error handling;\n- prompt-injection boundary that treats source material as untrusted evidence;\n- deterministic CONSECUTIVE_TRUE, K_OF_N, and SPACED_TRUE policies;\n- append-only observation links preserved across reset generations;\n- irreversible and resettable modes with generation overflow guard;\n- generation invalidation after reset;\n- typed `is_latched` consumer interface;\n- ConditionGate typed IC-to-IC consumer with pinned definition/generation, replay protection, and consumption event;\n- expanded Direct Mode adversarial tests;\n- GitHub Actions Direct Mode workflow;\n- full Studionet lifecycle integration test;\n- immutable fixture pinning script;\n- normal and final repository preflight;\n- stable Studionet / chain 61999 network configuration;\n- no frontend.\n\n## Remaining live-only proof\n\nThe only evidence that must not be fabricated is the actual stable Studionet deployment/lifecycle proof: finalized addresses, transaction evidence, live observation hashes, gate success/rejection evidence, and final post-deployment documentation. `DEPLOYMENT.md` remains explicit about these fields until they are produced.\n"},{"path":"DEPLOYMENT.md","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"# Deployment evidence\n\nTarget network only:\n\n- alias: `studionet`\n- chain ID: `61999`\n- RPC: `https://studio.genlayer.com/api`\n\n## Status\n\nNot deployed by this handoff package. No address or transaction hash below should be filled until produced by a real run.\n\n## Required final evidence\n\n| Item | Evidence |\n|---|---|\n| ConditionLatch address | PENDING |\n| ConditionLatch deploy transaction | PENDING |\n| ConditionGate address | PENDING |\n| ConditionGate deploy transaction | PENDING |\n| Condition create transaction | PENDING |\n| Source add transaction(s) | PENDING |\n| Seal transaction | PENDING |\n| Definition hash | PENDING |\n| Generation | PENDING |\n| Observation transaction #1 | PENDING |\n| Observation transaction #2 | PENDING |\n| Observation transaction #3 / latch | PENDING |\n| Allowed ConditionGate consumption | PENDING |\n| Replay rejection evidence | PENDING |\n| Wrong definition/generation rejection evidence | PENDING |\n| Final commit SHA | PENDING |\n| Direct Mode command/result | PENDING |\n| Final preflight command/result | PENDING |\n\nNever invent missing proof.\n\n## Immutable fixture pin\n\nFixture commit: `FIXTURE_COMMIT_PLACEHOLDER`\n\nCanonical TRUE fixture: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BeatyXO/conditionlatch/FIXTURE_COMMIT_PLACEHOLDER/fixtures/outage_true.txt`\n"},{"path":"LICENSE","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"MIT License\n\nCopyright (c) 2026\n\nPermission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\nof this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\nin the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\nto use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\ncopies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\nfurnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\nThe above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\ncopies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\nTHE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\nIMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\nFITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\nAUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\nLIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\nOUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\nSOFTWARE.\n"},{"path":"MANIFEST.json","mode":"100644","type":"blob","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"ConditionLatch\",\n  \"type\": \"standalone-genlayer-intelligent-contract-primitive\",\n  \"frontend\": false,\n  \"network\": {\n    \